    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index fell 175 points over the past week to 7,318 points, breaking a 5-week streak of improving rates. SSY’s assessed Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate decreased $0.75/t from the previous week to $10.40/t, while the Pacific round-voyage rate went down $3,750/day week-on-week to $22,750/ day.",
